<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Our esteemed company, ABC Transmovers Pune, takes pride in employing a comprehensive multi-layer packaging protocol tailored to withstand the challenges of the <strong>NCR Packers and Movers Pune</strong>'s rigorous journey between Pune and Bangalore.</span></li></ul>
	<p>The meticulous process ensures that your possessions reach their destination in pristine condition, despite the possible <strong>asap movers Bangalore</strong> weather conditions, particularly during the <strong>monsoon season</strong>.</p>
	<p>To enhance your peace of mind, we have created a detailed protocol encompassing the following five essential steps:</p>
	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Step 1: Heavy-Duty Air-Bubble Wrap (80-GSM)</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Our first line of defense is a robust and resilient 80-GSM heavy-duty air-bubble wrap. This material is designed to cushion your belongings and absorb shock, protecting them from potential damage during the journey.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
