        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard highway transit between Pune and Banglore takes approximately 2 to 3 Working Days via dedicated GPS-monitored container trucks with dual-driver rotations ensuring continuous safe movement.</p>
